More of a mom-and-pop than a touristy spot and that's the way I like it."},{"business_id":"w-0Gm5hKaX6mHRXoA0Ylrg","review_id":"X7fnJhNOra3fwjPr1IWxRw","date":"2012-02-07T18:45:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9291048645973206,"text_excerpt":"If you're in a hurry, this is not the place for you. They even post it on the wall. We enjoyed the fried chicken and it was oh so good!! It was piping hot and crispy. I tried red beans and rice for the first time here. I'm not a huge fan of beans. It had a good smoky flavor. Not something I would have all the time, but I think if you're a red beans and rice fan, you'd enjoy Fiorella's Cafe. The service was good. She was friendly and I believe the owner was there too. She was friendly and spoke freely with us from behind the bar. If you're in the mood for fried chicken, this is your spot!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"w-0Gm5hKaX6mHRXoA0Ylrg","photo_id":"oEdib4LexrcblFMdN6viPA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/oEdib4LexrcblFMdN6viPA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8917115926742554},{"business_id":"w-0Gm5hKaX6mHRXoA0Ylrg","photo_id":"IGgi9PljotJCGQwOGnFa7Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/IGgi9PljotJCGQwOGnFa7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.797434389591217},{"business_id":"w-0Gm5hKaX6mHRXoA0Ylrg","photo_id":"VB2ikb6lHkMxo0FSFoJQ-w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VB2ikb6lHkMxo0FSFoJQ-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7852338552474976},{"business_id":"w-0Gm5hKaX6mHRXoA0Ylrg","photo_id":"073V1ZjBFaI53ZXfJr31mQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/073V1ZjBFaI53ZXfJr31mQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7777678966522217}]},"notebook_case":null}
